WEBVTT

00:01:14.679 --> 00:01:29.569
Cardcaptor Sakura: The Movie
The Sealed Card

00:01:57.055 --> 00:01:59.724
The Key which hides
powers of the Stars...

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:02.060
Show your true form before me!

00:02:03.936 --> 00:02:06.773
I, Sakura, command you
under our contract!

00:02:07.315 --> 00:02:09.150
RELEASE!

00:02:20.453 --> 00:02:21.287
JUMP!

00:02:38.262 --> 00:02:39.222
WATERY!

00:02:54.362 --> 00:02:55.321
SHIELD!

00:03:30.773 --> 00:03:31.733
SWORD!

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.467
This is so wonderful!

00:03:57.467 --> 00:04:00.219
Th-This even has
background music...

00:04:00.219 --> 00:04:04.098
Of course, I took the liberty
of adding it during editing.

00:04:04.432 --> 00:04:08.603
Finding music perfectly timed
to all the scenes was difficult...

00:04:08.811 --> 00:04:12.106
But it was all for you, Sakura!

00:04:14.025 --> 00:04:17.737
Man, I really do look studly.

00:04:18.738 --> 00:04:20.573
All right, let's watch it again.

00:04:20.823 --> 00:04:22.366
K-Kero!

00:04:22.533 --> 00:04:25.661
Because you helped me out, Sakura...

00:04:25.661 --> 00:04:28.080
I was able to shoot
wonderful footage.

00:04:28.498 --> 00:04:30.041
You're embarrassing me.

00:04:30.082 --> 00:04:32.376
There's no reason
to be embarrassed.

00:04:32.376 --> 00:04:35.588
You turned all the cards
into Sakura Cards,

00:04:35.588 --> 00:04:38.800
and matured into
an amazing magical girl.

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:42.595
But she's still late all the time,
even though she's in the 6th grade.

00:04:42.595 --> 00:04:43.721
Kero!

00:04:45.848 --> 00:04:48.601
Anyway, this really looks good.

00:04:48.601 --> 00:04:51.604
The enemy we made
using CREATE isn't that bad, either.

00:04:52.522 --> 00:04:54.023
Before I used CREATE,

00:04:54.023 --> 00:04:57.527
I read tons of fantasy novels
I borrowed from Naoko.

00:04:57.527 --> 00:05:02.156
Now that Hiiragizawa has gone home
and there's no more real disturbances,

00:05:02.156 --> 00:05:05.618
a little screenwriting
and exaggeration is inevitable.

00:05:06.077 --> 00:05:08.579
Tomoyo, you're a pretty wicked girl.

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:13.251
I'll use any means necessary to film her...

00:05:13.251 --> 00:05:15.962
...wearing the clothes I made.

00:05:21.926 --> 00:05:25.429
So what other cards did you want
to record being captured?

00:05:26.597 --> 00:05:30.893
BUBBLE, DASH,
FLOAT, FREEZE...

00:05:30.893 --> 00:05:33.062
Oh, CHANGE would be nice, too!

00:05:33.062 --> 00:05:34.522
I don't wanna!

00:05:34.522 --> 00:05:36.941
Switching myself
with that kid again...

00:05:36.941 --> 00:05:38.776
- Then FLOWER?
- Syaoran...

00:05:38.776 --> 00:05:40.778
Oh, how about SWEET?

00:05:40.778 --> 00:05:42.321
Doesn't it sound yummy?

00:05:42.947 --> 00:05:43.865
Hey!

00:05:45.658 --> 00:05:47.410
Be careful! It's coming again!

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:48.286
Yeah!

00:05:49.412 --> 00:05:52.832
Oh, there was still
an unedited scene here?

00:05:52.832 --> 00:05:55.459
Oh, I'm there, too!

00:05:55.459 --> 00:05:57.628
I really do look awesome...

00:06:00.798 --> 00:06:02.717
Petals of Wind, answer my call!

00:06:04.719 --> 00:06:06.846
Now! Hurry up and seal it!

00:06:06.846 --> 00:06:07.930
Right!

00:06:08.014 --> 00:06:12.435
It's already been four months
since Li returned to Hong Kong.

00:06:12.727 --> 00:06:13.811
Yeah...

00:06:14.145 --> 00:06:16.022
- Are you all right?
- Yeah.

00:06:16.522 --> 00:06:17.523
I'm glad.

00:06:20.776 --> 00:06:23.487
Tomoyo, you knew...

00:06:23.905 --> 00:06:25.907
...about Syaoran's feelings.

00:06:26.574 --> 00:06:27.533
Yes.

00:06:27.742 --> 00:06:31.037
I was the only one who
didn't notice them, I guess...

00:06:31.287 --> 00:06:37.376
I think that innocence is why
Li fell in love with you, Sakura.

00:06:39.795 --> 00:06:41.005
But...

00:06:41.422 --> 00:06:46.177
Syaoran said that he I-liked me...

00:06:46.594 --> 00:06:50.222
But I haven't properly
replied to him yet.

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:52.892
How about by
telephone or by letter?

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.312
Syaoran told me so in person.

00:06:59.106 --> 00:07:02.944
So I want to see him
and tell him properly, too.

00:07:09.992 --> 00:07:11.786
I'm going to be late!

00:07:15.539 --> 00:07:18.250
Once again, the typical daily routine...

00:07:18.584 --> 00:07:22.046
I got used to waking up so late
because of summer break.

00:07:23.714 --> 00:07:26.342
You're in uniform,
so today's a school day?

00:07:26.509 --> 00:07:29.303
Yeah, to get ready for
the Nadeshiko Festival.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:33.182
Oh, school's in session for that festival
all of Tomoeda participates in?

00:07:33.432 --> 00:07:34.141
Yeah.

00:07:34.767 --> 00:07:40.439
Class 6-2 is representing Tomoeda Elementary
with a play, and Naoko wrote the script.

00:07:41.774 --> 00:07:44.360
And what role are you playing?

00:07:44.860 --> 00:07:46.779
A-A princess.

00:07:46.862 --> 00:07:50.741
Oh man, the princess has
gotta be the lead role!

00:07:50.741 --> 00:07:53.661
That means I have to
figure out a way to see it.

00:07:57.498 --> 00:08:03.004
That kid was the princess last time...

00:08:05.548 --> 00:08:08.092
What a horrible, horrible sight!

00:08:12.555 --> 00:08:13.973
By the way, Sakura...

00:08:15.516 --> 00:08:17.518
You goin' to school like that?

00:08:31.157 --> 00:08:32.241
Morning!

00:08:32.241 --> 00:08:33.868
Good morning, Sakura.

00:08:34.535 --> 00:08:35.578
Morning!

00:08:40.541 --> 00:08:41.751
Late morning.

00:08:43.294 --> 00:08:45.796
GOOD MORNING!

00:08:46.255 --> 00:08:47.840
Late morning...

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:48.924
...monster.

00:08:48.924 --> 00:08:51.093
I'm not a monster!

00:08:52.053 --> 00:08:53.888
Now, now, both of you.

00:08:55.681 --> 00:08:57.933
If we don't hurry, we'll be late.

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:00.561
Now, let's eat.

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:01.896
Yeah.

00:09:02.646 --> 00:09:04.482
Time to eat!

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:15.117
Say, you usually
start in the afternoon...

00:09:15.326 --> 00:09:16.827
You're rather early today.

00:09:17.411 --> 00:09:19.955
Yeah, we only have
one week left.

00:09:19.955 --> 00:09:22.458
There are a lot of spots
I can't perform well yet,

00:09:22.458 --> 00:09:24.543
so I have to practice
more for the play.

00:09:27.296 --> 00:09:28.964
I look forward to seeing it.

00:09:31.717 --> 00:09:34.011
A play where a monster is in the lead role.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:37.098
Wouldn't the Nadeshiko Festival...

00:09:37.848 --> 00:09:39.141
...get wrecked?

00:09:42.937 --> 00:09:44.105
What about you, Toya?

00:09:44.355 --> 00:09:47.149
My college will have a parlor,
so I'm helping out.

00:09:48.234 --> 00:09:49.443
Yukito too?

00:09:50.528 --> 00:09:52.613
We do go to the same college.

00:09:52.822 --> 00:09:53.864
Woohoo!

00:09:54.031 --> 00:09:55.783
I'll have to check it out!

00:09:56.283 --> 00:09:59.245
I'll make sure to put Tabasco
in what we serve you.

00:10:09.463 --> 00:10:09.588
Nadeshiko Festival

00:10:09.588 --> 00:10:10.798
Nadeshiko Festival
Wow...

00:10:10.798 --> 00:10:11.465
Nadeshiko Festival The
preparations are coming along so well...

00:10:11.465 --> 00:10:13.300
The preparations are
coming along so well...

00:10:14.135 --> 00:10:17.138
All of Tomoeda
is involved with this festival.

00:10:17.138 --> 00:10:18.848
I'm so looking forward to it!

00:10:21.851 --> 00:10:24.228
The play's going to be held here...

00:10:24.603 --> 00:10:26.814
It makes me nervous...

00:10:27.648 --> 00:10:29.733
Oh no, I'm going to be late!

00:10:30.442 --> 00:10:32.361
Please, Princess...

00:10:33.195 --> 00:10:36.824
Do stop crying.
A smile suits you more...

00:10:36.824 --> 00:10:38.159
Sakura!

00:10:38.367 --> 00:10:40.286
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:10:40.286 --> 00:10:41.704
- Sakura.
- Yes?!

00:10:41.871 --> 00:10:44.248
I added a couple of lines.

00:10:44.373 --> 00:10:46.208
Can you try acting it out?

00:10:46.208 --> 00:10:47.293
S-Sure.

00:10:47.293 --> 00:10:50.045
Here. These are the new lines.

00:10:50.212 --> 00:10:51.714
Yeah, I'll try it.

00:10:51.839 --> 00:10:54.884
Let's do it over from where
we just were, Yamazaki.

00:10:54.884 --> 00:10:55.926
Okay!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.803
Then let's start!

00:10:58.888 --> 00:11:00.931
Please, Princess...

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.058
Do stop crying-

00:11:03.058 --> 00:11:05.978
A smile suits you
more than anyone.

00:11:05.978 --> 00:11:09.190
Please forgive me
for making you so sad.

00:11:09.523 --> 00:11:12.776
However, I cannot
stop these feelings.

00:11:13.736 --> 00:11:16.322
I am in love with you.

00:11:17.072 --> 00:11:18.324
I---

00:11:18.574 --> 00:11:20.117
I---

00:11:23.412 --> 00:11:26.707
How I feel about you...

00:11:27.041 --> 00:11:30.169
Oh, it's so hard!

00:11:30.169 --> 00:11:33.464
Being the princess for the
first time makes me nervous!

00:11:33.839 --> 00:11:35.216
It's all right.

00:11:35.216 --> 00:11:39.637
Your acting is becoming
more and more princess-like each day.

00:11:39.637 --> 00:11:41.096
Oh, you think so?

00:11:41.263 --> 00:11:44.725
As the one allowed to film
each day's practice,

00:11:44.725 --> 00:11:46.810
I assure you.

00:11:47.311 --> 00:11:48.938
Then I guess it's okay.

00:11:55.277 --> 00:11:55.736
Tomoeda Amusement Park

00:11:55.736 --> 00:11:57.780
Tomoeda Amusement Park
Tomoeda Amusement Park...

00:11:57.780 --> 00:11:58.280
Tomoeda Amusement Park

00:11:58.280 --> 00:12:01.784
They built it on the hill,
come to think of it.

00:12:01.784 --> 00:12:04.995
Yeah, where Eriol's house used to be.

00:12:05.454 --> 00:12:07.539
I wonder if Eriol's doing well?

00:12:07.539 --> 00:12:10.251
Would you like to drop by
on the way back tomorrow?

00:12:10.542 --> 00:12:11.335
Yeah!

00:12:15.673 --> 00:12:19.551
As if my heart
were not my own...

00:12:20.135 --> 00:12:23.180
I cannot fall in love with him.

00:12:23.764 --> 00:12:27.184
Yet I cannot stop my own heart.

00:12:27.184 --> 00:12:30.396
I cannot forget his kind smile.

00:12:31.855 --> 00:12:33.857
I want to see him.

00:12:34.608 --> 00:12:39.363
I want to see him...
and tell him how I truly feel.

00:12:42.408 --> 00:12:45.077
I can still eat some more...

00:12:52.209 --> 00:12:53.752
Syaoran...

00:13:02.761 --> 00:13:11.520
Tomoeda Amusement Park

00:13:39.965 --> 00:13:45.262
Tomoeda Amusement Park

00:13:46.305 --> 00:13:48.766
Eriol's house is completely gone...

00:13:48.766 --> 00:13:50.351
Yeah...

00:13:53.729 --> 00:13:55.397
Is something wrong?

00:13:55.814 --> 00:13:57.441
I felt a presence...

00:13:57.524 --> 00:13:58.442
A presence?

00:14:02.112 --> 00:14:04.656
Inside the amusement park?

00:14:05.866 --> 00:14:07.159
Sakura!

00:14:07.659 --> 00:14:10.037
I know this presence...

00:14:10.954 --> 00:14:12.331
This presence is...

00:14:15.626 --> 00:14:17.961
Sorry, I was looking
the other way...

00:14:23.425 --> 00:14:25.302
What? Did something pop up?

00:14:26.303 --> 00:14:27.596
You too, Meiling?

00:14:30.182 --> 00:14:31.975
When did you arrive in Japan?

00:14:32.768 --> 00:14:34.103
Just a little while ago.

00:14:34.686 --> 00:14:37.564
I would've picked you up
if you had let me know.

00:14:37.564 --> 00:14:40.359
I kept quiet because
I wanted to surprise you.

00:14:42.236 --> 00:14:44.363
Well, I was definitely surprised!

00:14:44.571 --> 00:14:46.532
Then the mission
was a success.

00:14:47.241 --> 00:14:49.368
Oh, it's nothing!

00:14:49.701 --> 00:14:51.787
So you're going to be in a play?

00:14:51.787 --> 00:14:52.830
That's right.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.165
It's in a week.
Can you stay that long?

00:14:55.541 --> 00:14:57.418
- I intend to.
- Yay!

00:14:57.418 --> 00:14:58.961
Let's hang out together!

00:15:00.712 --> 00:15:04.550
And what I wrote
in that last letter is true.

00:15:05.592 --> 00:15:08.512
How Syaoran and I
canceled our engagement.

00:15:10.139 --> 00:15:12.724
Syaoran has someone he likes.

00:15:12.724 --> 00:15:16.478
I only want someone who'll like me
more than anyone else.

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:20.858
Syaoran said he asked her out,
but hasn't gotten an answer yet.

00:15:21.316 --> 00:15:25.779
Syaoran's a dear cousin to me,
so I hope everything goes well...

00:15:34.037 --> 00:15:36.915
Are Hong Kong schools
on summer break, as well?

00:15:36.999 --> 00:15:37.791
Yeah.

00:15:38.125 --> 00:15:41.628
Meiling suddenly said
she wanted to go to Japan.

00:15:41.628 --> 00:15:44.381
Well, Tomoeda City
is having a festival now.

00:15:44.965 --> 00:15:46.091
Daidoji...

00:15:46.091 --> 00:15:48.552
You've been swapping
e-mails with Meiling?

00:15:48.635 --> 00:15:49.595
Yes.

00:15:50.012 --> 00:15:53.056
Were you the one
who invited Meiling to Japan?

00:15:53.056 --> 00:15:54.850
Did I trouble you?

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:56.351
I---

00:15:56.477 --> 00:15:59.646
Did you not want
to see Sakura again?

00:16:00.355 --> 00:16:02.149
Of course I did...

00:16:03.442 --> 00:16:06.195
But it'll trouble her.

00:16:07.529 --> 00:16:10.574
She'll have to reply to me now...

00:16:15.704 --> 00:16:18.290
Where are you guys
going to stay?

00:16:18.457 --> 00:16:21.168
I'm thinking of staying
at Miss Daidoji's.

00:16:21.251 --> 00:16:22.419
Oh, I see.

00:16:22.419 --> 00:16:24.630
Then how about
dinner at my place?

00:16:24.630 --> 00:16:26.423
I'll do my best to cook.

00:16:26.757 --> 00:16:27.883
Thank you.

00:16:27.883 --> 00:16:31.178
But I have something to do
with Miss Daidoji.

00:16:33.263 --> 00:16:34.515
That's right!

00:16:35.474 --> 00:16:36.391
Sorry.

00:16:36.391 --> 00:16:39.520
No, it's my fault
for bringing it up so suddenly.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.272
You can still treat Syaoran
to a meal, though, right?

00:16:44.441 --> 00:16:45.859
- What?!
- What?!

00:16:47.819 --> 00:16:50.906
Well, Syaoran, I'll see you
later tonight at Miss Daidoji's.

00:16:51.323 --> 00:16:52.366
Let's go.

00:16:52.533 --> 00:16:53.867
<i>Hey, Netting!</i>

00:16:56.495 --> 00:16:58.080
U-Um...

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.123
Is pasta okay for dinner?

00:17:00.165 --> 00:17:01.625
Y-Yeah...

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:08.090
<i>Netting, you really are a kind person.</i>

00:17:08.423 --> 00:17:11.134
I mean, both of them
are really dense.

00:17:11.385 --> 00:17:15.347
It would be nice if Sakura
is able to reply to Li...

00:17:16.139 --> 00:17:17.266
That's true.

00:17:19.935 --> 00:17:21.270
Please sit down.

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:22.938
I'll make some tea first.

00:17:22.938 --> 00:17:24.565
Oh, there's some cake.

00:17:24.565 --> 00:17:26.149
Dad baked one.

00:17:39.788 --> 00:17:40.872
Want some help?

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.875
It's all right.
I'm almost done, so just wait.

00:17:44.209 --> 00:17:45.502
S-Sure.

00:17:56.513 --> 00:17:57.889
Sorry for the wait.

00:18:06.064 --> 00:18:07.399
How much sugar?

00:18:07.399 --> 00:18:09.526
I-It's all right. I'll do it myself...

00:18:12.904 --> 00:18:14.156
S-Sorry.

00:18:14.156 --> 00:18:15.699
I-It's okay.

00:18:27.878 --> 00:18:31.298
U-Um, Syaoran...

00:18:33.675 --> 00:18:34.760
I---

00:18:34.885 --> 00:18:35.886
I---

00:18:35.886 --> 00:18:37.596
Syaoran, about your...

00:18:37.596 --> 00:18:39.973
I smell cake!

00:18:39.973 --> 00:18:41.350
K-Kero!

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:42.351
Kerberos!

00:18:42.351 --> 00:18:44.269
Hey, it's the kid!

00:18:44.269 --> 00:18:45.937
When'd you get back here?

00:18:45.937 --> 00:18:49.066
Were you trying to eat cake
and keep it a secret?

00:18:49.066 --> 00:18:51.151
I-It wasn't a secret!

00:18:51.151 --> 00:18:53.236
You didn't call me!

00:18:53.403 --> 00:18:55.906
I... I have to get dinner ready.

00:18:55.906 --> 00:18:57.616
You two eat the cake.

00:19:00.786 --> 00:19:03.163
All right, I get the bigger one!

00:19:04.081 --> 00:19:06.166
You still have a greedy appetite.

00:19:06.625 --> 00:19:09.294
Even if you ask,
I won't switch with you.

00:19:09.586 --> 00:19:11.838
Like I would.
Don't think I'm like you.

00:19:13.298 --> 00:19:15.550
How dare a kid talk to me like that!

00:19:15.550 --> 00:19:16.843
Who's a kid?

00:19:20.138 --> 00:19:23.517
You are a kid compared
to an awesome creature like me.

00:19:23.517 --> 00:19:25.519
Move! Get off me!

00:19:25.519 --> 00:19:28.730
Considering you're here,
then the brat's here, too?

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:29.314
I have to show my wonderful
and awesome true self to that brat.

00:19:29.314 --> 00:19:30.357
You're heavy... I have to show my wonderful
and awesome true self to that brat.

00:19:30.357 --> 00:19:31.024
I have to show my wonderful
and awesome true self to that brat.

00:19:31.024 --> 00:19:31.858
Come on! I have to show my wonderful
and awesome true self to that brat.

00:19:31.858 --> 00:19:32.651
I have to show my wonderful
and awesome true self to that brat.

00:19:32.651 --> 00:19:33.443
Hey! I have to show my wonderful
and awesome true self to that brat.

00:19:33.443 --> 00:19:34.027
I have to show my wonderful
and awesome true self to that brat.

00:19:34.027 --> 00:19:36.071
Really, now...

00:19:36.071 --> 00:19:37.280
Get off!!

00:19:39.116 --> 00:19:41.201
My heart is racing...

00:19:41.201 --> 00:19:44.037
...and I thought I wouldn't
be able to breathe anymore.

00:19:46.581 --> 00:19:50.794
But I have to tell Syaoran how I feel.

00:19:51.294 --> 00:19:53.505
We're no longer apart, after all.

00:19:56.925 --> 00:19:58.343
Yummy!

00:19:58.343 --> 00:19:59.970
Boy, did I eat!

00:20:01.346 --> 00:20:02.472
Thanks for the meal.

00:20:02.723 --> 00:20:04.474
Was it a little too bland?

00:20:04.558 --> 00:20:06.226
No, it was delicious.

00:20:06.852 --> 00:20:10.564
I'm sorry for making
a guest like you help out.

00:20:12.357 --> 00:20:14.776
All the kid did was
tear the lettuce.

00:20:14.776 --> 00:20:17.112
But you didn't do anything, Kero.

00:20:17.279 --> 00:20:19.740
I was busy eating the cake.

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:20.991
What's gotten into you?

00:20:20.991 --> 00:20:24.953
I'm always putting on
a serious battle against tasty food.

00:20:25.162 --> 00:20:27.622
In other words,
you're a greedy, little pig.

00:20:28.206 --> 00:20:29.332
You wanna fight?

00:20:32.085 --> 00:20:33.295
Kero!

00:20:34.713 --> 00:20:37.048
Your life has been spared, kid.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:39.885
Where are you going?

00:20:40.427 --> 00:20:44.806
I've been playing games in the room all day.
My eyes are giving out.

00:20:44.806 --> 00:20:47.184
It's a little early,
but I'm sleeping now.

00:20:48.059 --> 00:20:51.521
But if you have a shack,
make sure to call me down!

00:20:55.358 --> 00:20:57.402
Kero really does...

00:20:57.736 --> 00:20:59.571
...have one greedy appetite.

00:20:59.738 --> 00:21:00.655
Yeah.

00:21:08.455 --> 00:21:10.248
Y-You know...

00:21:10.248 --> 00:21:12.250
About what I was saying before...

00:21:16.379 --> 00:21:17.672
I---

00:21:18.089 --> 00:21:19.132
I'm home!

00:21:21.301 --> 00:21:24.137
Sakura, about tonight's dinner...

00:21:24.763 --> 00:21:25.806
You.

00:21:27.474 --> 00:21:28.725
Sorry for the bother...

00:21:29.017 --> 00:21:30.352
Yukito!

00:21:30.519 --> 00:21:32.395
Good evening, Sakura.

00:21:32.604 --> 00:21:33.480
Oh!

00:21:39.069 --> 00:21:41.321
- I'll see you to the bus stop.
- It's okay.

00:21:41.321 --> 00:21:42.322
But...

00:21:42.489 --> 00:21:43.615
I'm all right.

00:21:46.743 --> 00:21:48.703
Well, thanks for the meal.

00:21:48.703 --> 00:21:49.830
U-Um...

00:21:50.038 --> 00:21:51.915
Will you come to school tomorrow?

00:21:51.915 --> 00:21:54.626
Yeah, I want to see
Yamazaki and the others.

00:21:54.835 --> 00:21:56.795
Then I'll see you tomorrow.

00:21:57.963 --> 00:21:59.005
Yeah.

00:21:59.714 --> 00:22:02.133
- See you tomorrow.
- See you tomorrow.

00:22:08.348 --> 00:22:10.517
You're in a bad mood, Toya.

00:22:10.892 --> 00:22:13.520
That twerp actually came by...

00:22:14.479 --> 00:22:17.607
But Sakura seemed
very happy about it.

00:22:18.108 --> 00:22:19.734
That's why I'm so pissed off!

00:22:20.986 --> 00:22:25.949
Toya, you just can't help doting
on your precious sister, can you?

00:22:26.032 --> 00:22:27.033
Shut up!

00:22:52.058 --> 00:22:53.518
Syaoran...

00:23:30.722 --> 00:23:32.891
- Meili na! NThe

00:23:33.516 --> 00:23:35.101
It's been a while!

00:23:35.852 --> 00:23:37.687
When did you get here?

00:23:37.771 --> 00:23:38.897
Yesterday.

00:23:39.147 --> 00:23:41.274
Are you here to see the festival?

00:23:41.691 --> 00:23:43.401
Among other things...

00:23:47.197 --> 00:23:50.241
Li, I think you grew
a little bit taller.

00:23:50.492 --> 00:23:52.535
J-Just a little bit.

00:23:52.535 --> 00:23:54.204
- It seems so.
- Yeah...

00:23:56.581 --> 00:24:01.211
Sorrowful Love
Written by Naoko Yanagisawa

00:24:02.045 --> 00:24:05.256
Looks like she couldn't bring
herself to say anything last night.

00:24:05.256 --> 00:24:08.134
When Li came back
from Sakura's house...

00:24:08.134 --> 00:24:10.929
...he wasn't acting
any differently than usual.

00:24:11.721 --> 00:24:14.683
And I went out of my way
to get them alone together!

00:24:16.101 --> 00:24:19.437
But this means that
I have another chance!

00:24:20.563 --> 00:24:21.481
For what?

00:24:21.564 --> 00:24:25.735
To film Sakura as she
makes her confession of love!

00:24:26.987 --> 00:24:30.991
Y-You still haven't
changed a bit, Miss Daidoji.

00:24:35.829 --> 00:24:36.746
Morning!

00:24:37.956 --> 00:24:39.958
Sorry, am I late again?

00:24:40.083 --> 00:24:41.710
You made it just in time.

00:24:41.960 --> 00:24:43.336
I'm so glad!

00:24:43.837 --> 00:24:45.714
Then shall we begin?

00:24:45.839 --> 00:24:47.382
Sure!

00:24:51.970 --> 00:24:53.054
Morning.

00:24:55.306 --> 00:24:56.516
Morning...

00:24:58.852 --> 00:25:01.354
But the princess really is dense.

00:25:01.813 --> 00:25:04.441
She was actually asked out.

00:25:04.441 --> 00:25:06.985
She should reply right away, on the spot!

00:25:07.819 --> 00:25:12.240
Though you should consider
the timing and environment...

00:25:12.532 --> 00:25:14.659
He'd want a reply soon, right?

00:25:14.659 --> 00:25:16.161
Y-Yeah...

00:25:20.123 --> 00:25:23.293
It's quite a task,
but you have to have some courage!

00:25:23.835 --> 00:25:26.796
- For the play, and the other thing.
- Y-Yeah...

00:25:28.882 --> 00:25:31.843
Wait, the other thing?

00:25:35.138 --> 00:25:37.057
Wow, it sure is hot out!

00:25:37.057 --> 00:25:38.600
Which place is hotter?

00:25:38.600 --> 00:25:40.018
Hong Kong, of course!

00:25:41.352 --> 00:25:43.563
Hey, how about some juice?

00:25:43.938 --> 00:25:44.814
Sure.

00:25:44.814 --> 00:25:46.691
A good place just opened up.

00:25:47.942 --> 00:25:52.739
It's a shorter hike if we go up
this hill and turn at the mailbox.

00:25:52.906 --> 00:25:55.283
Oh, wait, Miss Kinomoto!

00:26:01.247 --> 00:26:04.542
Jeez, don't make me
run when it's so hot out!

00:26:10.006 --> 00:26:11.716
Is something the matter?

00:26:12.842 --> 00:26:15.720
Wasn't there a mailbox
around here somewhere?

00:26:15.845 --> 00:26:20.225
I don't know.
I don't usually travel along this road.

00:26:20.850 --> 00:26:22.727
Maybe they took it away?

00:26:23.478 --> 00:26:24.604
Maybe so.

00:26:24.604 --> 00:26:27.232
- It's this way, right?
- Y-Yeah.

00:26:27.690 --> 00:26:29.400
It's hot, so let's hurry.

00:26:39.077 --> 00:26:40.245
I'm home!

00:26:40.245 --> 00:26:41.371
Welcome back.

00:26:44.541 --> 00:26:46.751
Have you been playing
games all day again?

00:26:49.254 --> 00:26:50.588
Goal!!!

00:26:50.588 --> 00:26:52.298
I did it!

00:26:52.298 --> 00:26:54.759
First place! A course record!

00:26:54.759 --> 00:26:56.302
Yay! Hurray!

00:26:56.302 --> 00:26:59.097
I'll show him with this one!

00:26:59.097 --> 00:27:03.852
Hey, Sakura, you gonna write
another letter to Eriol in England?

00:27:04.144 --> 00:27:05.228
A letter?

00:27:05.228 --> 00:27:06.104
Yeah!

00:27:06.604 --> 00:27:08.022
I should...

00:27:08.106 --> 00:27:11.943
I'd like to tell him that
Syaoran and Meiling came over here.

00:27:12.193 --> 00:27:14.696
Then can you send my letter, too?

00:27:14.696 --> 00:27:17.282
I wanna tell Suppie
about my record time.

00:27:17.615 --> 00:27:20.368
Suppie... you mean Spinel?

00:27:20.368 --> 00:27:21.161
Yeah!

00:27:22.370 --> 00:27:26.166
You really get along
with Eriol's black cat.

00:27:26.291 --> 00:27:28.918
No, no, we don't get along at all.

00:27:29.169 --> 00:27:30.461
We're rivals!

00:27:33.631 --> 00:27:36.551
That damn Suppie,
this time I'm gonna win...

00:27:36.718 --> 00:27:41.014
You can't beat the record
I got oh so easily!

00:27:43.099 --> 00:27:44.684
How are you doing?

00:27:44.934 --> 00:27:47.270
It's very hot every day over here.

00:27:47.395 --> 00:27:49.397
As I wrote in my last letter,

00:27:49.397 --> 00:27:52.609
I'm busy every day preparing
for the Nadeshiko Festival.

00:27:53.067 --> 00:27:56.571
About which role
I'll be performing in the play...

00:27:56.571 --> 00:27:57.488
You were right.

00:27:57.488 --> 00:27:57.780
Suppie
You were right.

00:27:57.780 --> 00:27:58.156
Suppie

00:27:58.156 --> 00:28:00.325
Suppie I ended up
with the role of princess.

00:28:00.325 --> 00:28:00.533
Suppie

00:28:00.533 --> 00:28:02.911
Suppie For some reason,
I'm very nervous about it.

00:28:02.911 --> 00:28:03.286
Suppie

00:28:03.286 --> 00:28:05.455
Suppie
I hope I can perform well...

00:28:05.455 --> 00:28:07.415
Suppie

00:28:07.415 --> 00:28:09.542
Suppie
Just you wait, Suppie...

00:28:18.885 --> 00:28:20.220
Oh, right.

00:28:20.220 --> 00:28:22.597
They're also getting ready to open

00:28:22.597 --> 00:28:25.141
an amusement park
where your house used to be.

00:28:26.142 --> 00:28:30.855
Also, Syaoran and Meiling
are visiting from Hong Kong.

00:28:32.023 --> 00:28:36.027
Syaoran grew a little bit taller.

00:28:43.743 --> 00:28:45.328
Syaoran...

00:29:17.735 --> 00:29:19.946
The clouds are floating by.

00:29:19.946 --> 00:29:22.156
The winds start singing.

00:29:22.156 --> 00:29:26.577
Right near this road
that I always used to run on.

00:29:26.703 --> 00:29:34.752
White flowers bloom
and smile there now.

00:29:35.878 --> 00:29:40.091
But they never stop,
even if my heart is stuffed up.

00:29:40.174 --> 00:29:44.595
Because I love right now,
time passes by.

00:29:44.595 --> 00:29:52.687
It's like a piece of a dream
that I cried over in the past.

00:29:52.687 --> 00:29:58.359
A peace that floats gently,
like something fluffy...

00:29:58.359 --> 00:30:02.613
And doubt that makes tears flow.

00:30:02.613 --> 00:30:12.081
I'm sure they're both connected
to a precious future.

00:30:12.081 --> 00:30:16.044
So even if tomorrow comes...

00:30:16.044 --> 00:30:20.506
Even if we someday turn into adults...

00:30:20.506 --> 00:30:29.849
Please remember
that you were once here.

00:30:30.016 --> 00:30:38.399
Please don't forget,
even at the far ends of this world...

00:30:38.399 --> 00:30:42.945
The present that never fades away.

00:30:42.945 --> 00:30:49.327
Everyone, thank you.

00:30:49.327 --> 00:30:50.370
Tomoeda Nadeshiko Festival
Everyone, thank you.

00:30:50.370 --> 00:30:54.582
Tomoeda Nadeshiko Festival

00:30:56.918 --> 00:30:59.212
Wait just a minute.
I'll be right back.

00:30:59.379 --> 00:31:01.047
Let's go, Miss Daidoji.

00:31:01.381 --> 00:31:03.091
Oh, Meiling!

00:31:17.730 --> 00:31:20.066
Syaoran, um...

00:31:24.362 --> 00:31:25.530
I---

00:31:31.536 --> 00:31:32.537
I---

00:31:40.169 --> 00:31:41.921
Don't do that, Toya!

00:31:43.005 --> 00:31:44.215
Yukito?

00:31:48.010 --> 00:31:49.429
Big brother!

00:31:49.720 --> 00:31:51.597
You scared me!

00:31:52.598 --> 00:31:55.518
You were standing there dazed
and looking stupid.

00:31:58.646 --> 00:32:01.315
What's with all the yelling?

00:32:01.566 --> 00:32:03.359
I was just a little surprised.

00:32:03.651 --> 00:32:06.279
To make up for it,
we'll treat you all to ice cream.

00:32:06.279 --> 00:32:07.405
Right, Toya?

00:32:07.613 --> 00:32:08.656
Why do I...

00:32:09.740 --> 00:32:11.826
Because you interrupted Sakura.

00:32:14.871 --> 00:32:17.582
- Did you wait long?
- No, I just got here.

00:32:17.582 --> 00:32:17.957
Great.

00:32:19.542 --> 00:32:21.294
This side's okay.

00:32:21.961 --> 00:32:24.881
- Why'd I have to treat him, too?
- It's about to fall off.

00:32:25.631 --> 00:32:26.966
Delicious!

00:32:26.966 --> 00:32:29.135
Isn't it tasty?

00:32:29.218 --> 00:32:30.761
Thank you very much.

00:32:31.262 --> 00:32:33.347
Half of it is thanks to Toya.

00:32:36.058 --> 00:32:37.143
Have you found him?

00:32:39.353 --> 00:32:41.522
The person you like the most.

00:32:42.607 --> 00:32:43.524
Yes.

00:32:43.649 --> 00:32:44.942
I'm glad.

00:32:45.568 --> 00:32:47.320
Have you told that person yet?

00:32:48.488 --> 00:32:49.655
Not yet...

00:32:50.114 --> 00:32:51.240
I see.

00:32:51.407 --> 00:32:54.035
But I'm going to try my best to tell him.

00:32:55.369 --> 00:32:56.871
I'm cheering for you.

00:32:57.205 --> 00:32:59.874
I'm sure my other self is, too...

00:33:00.374 --> 00:33:01.292
Yeah!

00:33:13.012 --> 00:33:14.138
What's wrong?

00:33:14.263 --> 00:33:16.015
Oh, nothing.

00:33:16.724 --> 00:33:19.268
I thought something might've
happened to my bag...

00:33:32.281 --> 00:33:36.160
Remember how that video last night
said the plush was a real bear?

00:33:36.160 --> 00:33:39.038
Even if it grew bigger,
a plush is a plush!

00:33:39.038 --> 00:33:40.957
It's not like the insides change.

00:33:41.123 --> 00:33:42.083
What's wrong?

00:33:44.293 --> 00:33:45.336
Well...

00:33:45.336 --> 00:33:47.630
Did you feel something before?

00:33:47.964 --> 00:33:49.549
Something?
What do you mean?

00:33:51.425 --> 00:33:54.845
- Did something happen?
- No, it's nothing.

00:33:55.388 --> 00:33:59.183
If you didn't feel it,
I'm sure it was just me.

00:33:59.725 --> 00:34:00.851
What?!

00:34:06.524 --> 00:34:09.026
The bridge... is gone.

00:34:09.485 --> 00:34:11.445
Could it be under construction?

00:34:11.571 --> 00:34:14.991
But there were no signs
or warnings at all.

00:34:14.991 --> 00:34:16.951
Then why?

00:34:23.708 --> 00:34:26.460
What? A bridge disappeared?

00:34:26.544 --> 00:34:29.672
Yeah, the caretaker
of the park came by...

00:34:29.672 --> 00:34:31.716
...and was really surprised.

00:34:32.049 --> 00:34:34.510
Well, that's really weird.

00:34:34.760 --> 00:34:36.637
Eriol's not here anymore,

00:34:36.637 --> 00:34:40.016
and all the Clow Cards
have been turned into Sakura Cards.

00:34:40.182 --> 00:34:43.269
So something magical
should not have happened...

00:34:44.020 --> 00:34:46.105
You're right about that...

00:34:46.480 --> 00:34:51.861
That said, in case something else does happen
you should carry the Sakura Cards with you.

00:34:51.861 --> 00:34:52.695
Right.

00:34:58.367 --> 00:34:59.994
Yes, hello?

00:35:00.411 --> 00:35:02.330
Oh, Meiling!

00:35:04.540 --> 00:35:06.000
Yeah, right.

00:35:06.626 --> 00:35:08.794
We don't have
practice tomorrow.

00:35:11.589 --> 00:35:12.965
The amusement park?

00:35:25.311 --> 00:35:27.480
Oh, there she is!

00:35:29.023 --> 00:35:30.608
I\\ \ \ \\ !

00:35:30.608 --> 00:35:31.692
You're late!

00:35:37.073 --> 00:35:39.742
I was thinking about
a lot of things,

00:35:39.742 --> 00:35:42.620
and didn't fall asleep
until really late, so...

00:35:43.412 --> 00:35:44.497
It's all right.

00:35:44.497 --> 00:35:46.540
Well, everyone, let's hurry.

00:35:48.626 --> 00:35:49.752
Are you all right?

00:35:52.171 --> 00:35:53.673
Y-Yeah.

00:35:57.343 --> 00:36:00.429
It'd be nice if Sakura
could tell him today.

00:36:00.554 --> 00:36:02.014
Exactly.

00:36:02.181 --> 00:36:06.268
I set them up in an
amusement park for just that reason.

00:36:07.228 --> 00:36:12.400
But it's already been 5 days since I came
to Japan, and she still hasn't told him.

00:36:12.400 --> 00:36:14.402
Miss Kinomoto really is dense.

00:36:14.402 --> 00:36:17.697
But that's one of the good things about Sakura.

00:36:50.813 --> 00:36:52.523
Tomoyo!

00:36:59.822 --> 00:37:01.824
Oh, that was fun!

00:37:01.824 --> 00:37:03.451
Yes, very.

00:37:04.076 --> 00:37:06.704
Syaoran, you should've
gone on it with us!

00:37:06.871 --> 00:37:07.788
Yeah...

00:37:08.873 --> 00:37:11.500
Hey, Miss Kinomoto,
what do you want to go on next?

00:37:12.084 --> 00:37:12.960
What?

00:37:17.840 --> 00:37:18.758
All right.

00:37:19.592 --> 00:37:21.385
We'll ride that next!

00:37:22.845 --> 00:37:24.764
The Ferris wheel!

00:37:24.972 --> 00:37:28.184
I want to go on that
with Miss Daidoji.

00:37:28.476 --> 00:37:31.061
Miss Kinomoto,
you ride with Syaoran.

00:37:40.321 --> 00:37:42.531
You really do work hard, Miss Daidoji.

00:38:20.402 --> 00:38:21.654
Syaoran...

00:38:23.364 --> 00:38:24.198
What is it?

00:38:26.784 --> 00:38:27.868
I---

00:38:30.871 --> 00:38:34.416
About you, Syaoran, I...

00:38:50.850 --> 00:38:51.934
I felt something!

00:38:51.934 --> 00:38:52.893
It can't be!

00:38:53.310 --> 00:38:56.272
I'm sure Miss Kinomoto
has told him by now.

00:38:57.314 --> 00:39:00.192
If that's the case, they seem
to be acting strangely.

00:39:00.901 --> 00:39:02.194
Watch your step.

00:39:10.369 --> 00:39:12.454
This presence... It can't be...

00:39:17.668 --> 00:39:18.294
Mirror House

00:39:18.294 --> 00:39:20.796
Mirror House - I can feel the presence from here.
- Yeah.

00:39:20.796 --> 00:39:21.171
Mirror House

00:39:22.548 --> 00:39:23.382
Let's go.

00:39:34.101 --> 00:39:37.146
Syaoran, what I feel really is a...

00:39:37.146 --> 00:39:38.981
Yeah, no doubt about it.

00:39:39.732 --> 00:39:41.734
This is a Clow Card's presence.

00:39:42.026 --> 00:39:44.194
But I collected all the Clow Cards.

00:39:44.194 --> 00:39:45.070
So how?

00:39:45.154 --> 00:39:46.488
I don't know.

00:39:46.488 --> 00:39:51.118
But what I felt here 4 days ago
was definitely from a Clow Card, too.

00:39:51.869 --> 00:39:55.122
If I had known, I would've
brought my compass board...

00:39:59.335 --> 00:40:00.377
That's...

00:40:15.392 --> 00:40:16.769
The THROUGH Card!

00:40:16.769 --> 00:40:18.854
- If you go through the mirror...
- Right!

00:40:21.732 --> 00:40:23.943
It's gone!
The THROUGH Card's gone...

00:40:23.943 --> 00:40:25.903
That's impossible!

00:40:26.111 --> 00:40:27.404
Give them back...

00:40:27.571 --> 00:40:29.323
My friends...

00:40:43.253 --> 00:40:44.213
WOOD!

00:41:01.021 --> 00:41:02.064
She's gone...

00:41:02.106 --> 00:41:04.316
Yeah, the presence is gone, too.

00:41:10.322 --> 00:41:12.616
Your cards were stolen?!

00:41:14.493 --> 00:41:15.869
By who?

00:41:16.495 --> 00:41:18.330
A small girl...

00:41:18.789 --> 00:41:19.999
With long hair...

00:41:19.999 --> 00:41:21.375
A girl?

00:41:22.167 --> 00:41:23.961
But that presence was...

00:41:24.420 --> 00:41:25.754
It couldn't be...

00:41:28.966 --> 00:41:31.301
Who's calling during
an emergency like this?

00:41:34.805 --> 00:41:36.515
Yes, this is Sakura.

00:41:37.016 --> 00:41:39.435
It's been a while, Miss Sakura.

00:41:40.686 --> 00:41:41.895
Eriol?

00:41:43.856 --> 00:41:45.024
My mansion...

00:41:45.024 --> 00:41:49.153
Or rather, Clow Reed's mansion
has been demolished, correct?

00:41:49.737 --> 00:41:50.779
Yeah...

00:41:50.863 --> 00:41:55.117
Then the Clow Card sealed away
beneath it has been activated.

00:41:55.284 --> 00:41:58.037
Wasn't there only a total
of 52 Clow Cards?

00:41:58.037 --> 00:42:00.706
I never heard there was another one!

00:42:01.123 --> 00:42:03.959
The existence of
the Sealed Card...

00:42:04.334 --> 00:42:06.128
...was known only to Clow Reed.

00:42:07.755 --> 00:42:11.050
And that card
has never been used.

00:42:11.050 --> 00:42:12.176
What was that?

00:42:12.426 --> 00:42:14.178
What card is it?

00:42:14.887 --> 00:42:18.182
All Clow Cards
have positive power.

00:42:18.724 --> 00:42:22.269
The cards are always
used to create something.

00:42:23.562 --> 00:42:26.565
But this card is different.

00:42:27.691 --> 00:42:31.695
The card that was sealed away
returns everything to nothing.

00:42:32.321 --> 00:42:33.405
Nothing?

00:42:33.655 --> 00:42:36.700
It has the power
to unmake everything.

00:42:37.284 --> 00:42:40.829
Why did Clow make
such a dangerous card?

00:42:41.830 --> 00:42:44.708
The Clow Cards
have tremendous power.

00:42:44.917 --> 00:42:46.085
However...

00:42:46.085 --> 00:42:50.005
Magic that is too strong
breeds loss of both control and order.

00:42:50.506 --> 00:42:52.549
For there to be positive power,

00:42:52.549 --> 00:42:55.052
the same amount
of negative power is needed.

00:42:55.260 --> 00:42:58.222
That's the Chinese idea of yin-yang.

00:42:58.263 --> 00:43:04.269
The world's balance is kept because
equal powers pull against each other...

00:43:04.853 --> 00:43:06.480
Hey, wait a minute!

00:43:06.480 --> 00:43:08.649
This one Sealed Card...

00:43:08.649 --> 00:43:12.528
...has the same amount of magic power
as all 52 Clow Cards?

00:43:12.903 --> 00:43:14.154
Exactly.

00:43:14.154 --> 00:43:15.322
What?!

00:43:16.406 --> 00:43:18.951
When the Clow Cards
were Clow Cards...

00:43:19.368 --> 00:43:22.454
...the balance of positive
and negative was kept.

00:43:22.579 --> 00:43:27.501
But now that all 52 cards
have been turned into Sakura Cards,

00:43:27.793 --> 00:43:31.880
the one remaining card's seal
has been completely broken.

00:43:33.423 --> 00:43:37.302
If the memory I inherited
from Clow Reed had been complete...

00:43:38.178 --> 00:43:40.764
I could have told
you much sooner.

00:43:41.181 --> 00:43:44.852
Then the girl that I met today was...

00:43:45.144 --> 00:43:48.147
The last card, which had been sealed away.

00:43:48.355 --> 00:43:51.150
Miss Sakura, have you lost any cards?

00:43:51.191 --> 00:43:52.276
I have.

00:43:52.276 --> 00:43:55.154
That girl took a few of them today, too.

00:43:56.864 --> 00:43:58.740
Are parts of the city gone?

00:43:59.199 --> 00:44:00.200
The city?

00:44:00.409 --> 00:44:02.327
For instance, buildings.

00:44:05.914 --> 00:44:08.208
A mailbox and a bridge
did disappear...

00:44:08.542 --> 00:44:10.502
That is the card's power.

00:44:10.711 --> 00:44:13.881
That card, in order to take
the Sakura Cards,

00:44:13.881 --> 00:44:16.508
will continue to erase
things around you.

00:44:17.342 --> 00:44:20.429
Things, spaces, and people...

00:44:21.430 --> 00:44:22.890
That's not good!

00:44:22.890 --> 00:44:24.224
That's not right!

00:44:26.476 --> 00:44:27.352
Eriol.

00:44:29.104 --> 00:44:31.398
Miss Sakura, please listen.

00:44:31.690 --> 00:44:36.111
Balance will return if you
turn that card into a Sakura Card, too.

00:44:36.195 --> 00:44:38.363
So just turn it into
a Sakura Card?

00:44:38.739 --> 00:44:43.118
But in order to do so, you need to
give something in exchange.

00:44:43.160 --> 00:44:44.244
Something?

00:44:44.494 --> 00:44:45.662
What is it?

00:44:46.121 --> 00:44:50.000
The feeling held most dear
at the moment it's captured.

00:44:51.251 --> 00:44:54.671
The dearest... feeling...

00:44:55.756 --> 00:44:56.882
Whose?

00:44:56.882 --> 00:44:58.842
The card will decide whose.

00:44:59.218 --> 00:45:01.178
The person with stronger magic...

00:45:04.389 --> 00:45:05.766
But, Miss Sakura...

00:45:08.560 --> 00:45:09.519
Eriol?

00:45:09.728 --> 00:45:10.729
Eriol?

00:45:10.729 --> 00:45:12.397
Hey, what's going on?

00:45:15.692 --> 00:45:16.777
You were cut off?

00:45:18.695 --> 00:45:19.780
Yes.

00:45:20.322 --> 00:45:23.033
It realized I was there
and erased the phone line.

00:45:24.284 --> 00:45:26.286
It has much more
power than I thought.

00:45:26.703 --> 00:45:30.832
Do you know what the outcome
of all this will be, Eriol?

00:45:32.918 --> 00:45:34.002
No.

00:45:55.315 --> 00:45:57.359
Why did this have to happen?

00:45:57.567 --> 00:46:00.445
To die protecting me...

00:46:00.988 --> 00:46:05.492
There is no happiness for me
if you are not here.

00:46:06.535 --> 00:46:10.247
I wish I had told you how I feel...

00:46:16.545 --> 00:46:18.380
How I truly feel...

00:46:21.091 --> 00:46:25.095
This is my first time seeing it in full,
but it's written very well.

00:46:25.220 --> 00:46:27.848
Both of you were really good!

00:46:29.141 --> 00:46:30.976
I'm only sleeping.

00:46:30.976 --> 00:46:32.811
It's Miss Kinomoto who's good.

00:46:32.978 --> 00:46:34.938
By the way, speaking of sleep...

00:46:34.938 --> 00:46:37.232
You acted with lots of emotion.

00:46:37.232 --> 00:46:38.775
It was really good.

00:46:38.775 --> 00:46:39.901
Thanks.

00:46:40.152 --> 00:46:42.446
All right, tomorrow's the big day!

00:46:42.738 --> 00:46:45.115
Let's all do our best
for the festival!

00:46:45.115 --> 00:46:46.616
Okay!

00:46:48.243 --> 00:46:50.037
A card that was sealed away?

00:46:51.997 --> 00:46:55.125
It's apparently what we saw
at the amusement park yesterday.

00:46:55.792 --> 00:46:58.086
Did you also ask
what you should do?

00:46:59.546 --> 00:47:03.091
I'm supposed to turn it
into a Sakura Card, too.

00:47:05.969 --> 00:47:08.764
But to do that...

00:47:09.348 --> 00:47:13.060
I have to give up the feeling
I hold dearest in exchange.

00:47:14.895 --> 00:47:17.481
During the final judgment
of the Clow Cards,

00:47:17.647 --> 00:47:21.985
I saw a world that
had no feelings of love.

00:47:22.277 --> 00:47:24.529
It was a really lonely world.

00:47:26.448 --> 00:47:28.408
I never want to see that again.

00:47:28.825 --> 00:47:31.703
I absolutely don't want
to see something that sad!

00:47:32.662 --> 00:47:34.623
There's nothing else you can do?

00:47:35.415 --> 00:47:36.750
I don't know.

00:47:37.376 --> 00:47:40.379
Eriol's phone call was cut short...

00:47:51.890 --> 00:47:56.603
If there's no other way...
then that's what you have to do.

00:47:57.854 --> 00:47:59.272
Syaoran...

00:48:00.816 --> 00:48:03.735
You don't care if what's
in our hearts just disappears?

00:48:04.069 --> 00:48:08.615
If it means the city and its
people won't disappear, then...

00:48:37.144 --> 00:48:38.437
I\\ \ \ \\ !

00:48:40.021 --> 00:48:41.565
Are you all right, Sakura?

00:48:46.987 --> 00:48:48.989
Would I trouble you...

00:48:48.989 --> 00:48:51.366
...if I asked you what was wrong?

00:48:54.661 --> 00:48:56.788
Is it something I can ask about?

00:49:00.292 --> 00:49:03.628
Or would you rather
talk to my other self?

00:49:06.047 --> 00:49:10.260
My other self is saying that
he's very worried about you.

00:49:11.595 --> 00:49:12.679
I'll switch.

00:49:24.274 --> 00:49:26.526
I didn't say very...

00:49:28.737 --> 00:49:30.030
I see...

00:49:31.364 --> 00:49:33.992
Why must you always
end up in tough situations?

00:49:34.534 --> 00:49:36.495
It's not just me.

00:49:36.495 --> 00:49:38.038
Everyone's the same.

00:49:39.080 --> 00:49:42.000
I'm sure that Syaoran is, as well...

00:49:44.836 --> 00:49:48.632
That Sealed Card was also
something Clow created.

00:49:49.090 --> 00:49:53.970
Clow never made anything
that causes only harm to the world.

00:49:54.137 --> 00:49:55.138
Yeah...

00:49:55.805 --> 00:49:57.641
There has to be some way.

00:49:59.226 --> 00:50:02.145
A way to not lose
your dearest feeling.

00:50:03.939 --> 00:50:05.357
I'm sure you can do it.

00:50:05.815 --> 00:50:06.942
It will be all right.

00:50:09.236 --> 00:50:10.445
Thank you.

00:50:43.478 --> 00:50:44.938
It's finally time.

00:50:44.938 --> 00:50:46.439
I'm getting nervous.

00:50:46.439 --> 00:50:49.192
I hope lots of people
come to watch.

00:50:49.859 --> 00:50:53.238
To think there was
another Clow Card left...

00:50:53.321 --> 00:50:54.406
Yeah...

00:50:55.073 --> 00:50:58.326
Sakura, you look a little pale.

00:50:58.868 --> 00:51:01.705
It looks like you didn't
sleep much last night.

00:51:01.705 --> 00:51:03.123
Are you all right?

00:51:03.206 --> 00:51:04.124
Yeah.

00:51:06.167 --> 00:51:09.170
Hey, you talked to Syaoran
about this, right?

00:51:09.796 --> 00:51:10.880
Y-Yeah...

00:51:11.673 --> 00:51:12.966
Is that all?

00:51:12.966 --> 00:51:14.217
Yeah, thanks.

00:51:14.217 --> 00:51:16.011
Thanks for the hard work.

00:51:22.851 --> 00:51:24.060
This presence...

00:51:24.185 --> 00:51:25.270
A Clow Card!

00:51:33.403 --> 00:51:35.905
- What's that noise?
- Let's see.

00:51:35.905 --> 00:51:37.365
- Sakura!
- Yeah!

00:51:37.991 --> 00:51:39.242
SLEEP!

00:51:43.538 --> 00:51:45.707
I feel kind of sleepy...

00:51:47.792 --> 00:51:48.710
You all right?

00:51:48.918 --> 00:51:49.711
Yeah!

00:52:04.017 --> 00:52:05.477
Yamazaki!

00:52:07.437 --> 00:52:09.230
Hey, Yamazaki!
Are you all right?

00:52:11.399 --> 00:52:13.526
I just bumped something.

00:52:13.526 --> 00:52:15.487
I don't think you can go on...

00:52:15.487 --> 00:52:16.821
I'm all right.

00:52:17.280 --> 00:52:19.366
You're not all right!

00:52:19.658 --> 00:52:21.368
Are we canceling the play?

00:52:21.493 --> 00:52:22.661
We have no choice.

00:52:23.453 --> 00:52:25.121
You can't cancel it.

00:52:25.330 --> 00:52:27.749
But with that injury, Yamazaki...

00:52:28.166 --> 00:52:30.418
Someone else can take my place. Right...

00:52:30.418 --> 00:52:31.461
...Li?

00:52:32.629 --> 00:52:39.844
Sunlight at dusk casts
a red light onto the plains...

00:52:40.220 --> 00:52:42.097
Just like fire.

00:52:42.806 --> 00:52:46.017
Nadeshiko Festival

00:52:46.017 --> 00:52:49.396
Nadeshiko Festival I close my
eyes and look inside my heart.

00:52:49.396 --> 00:52:54.818
I close my eyes
and look inside my heart.

00:52:55.151 --> 00:53:01.825
Who am I waiting for?

00:53:03.576 --> 00:53:08.748
I am listening to a voice...

00:53:10.875 --> 00:53:18.508
...which comes from
the other side of the horizon.

00:53:19.259 --> 00:53:20.260
How is it?

00:53:20.260 --> 00:53:21.052
Hmm...!

00:53:22.387 --> 00:53:23.471
It's perfect!

00:53:23.805 --> 00:53:25.223
I'm glad.

00:53:25.890 --> 00:53:28.184
Tomoyo's song is over.

00:53:28.184 --> 00:53:30.353
Well, we're next.

00:53:30.437 --> 00:53:31.855
Sorrowful Love

00:53:31.855 --> 00:53:34.441
Sorrowful Love Please do your best,
Li and Meiling.

00:53:34.441 --> 00:53:34.566
Please do your best,
Li and Meiling.

00:53:34.566 --> 00:53:37.152
But the role of a maid...

00:53:37.152 --> 00:53:40.029
You're okay with this and this
as your lines, right?

00:53:43.116 --> 00:53:45.618
I've been to so many rehearsals,
I've got it down!

00:53:45.827 --> 00:53:47.412
Right, Syaoran?

00:53:48.788 --> 00:53:50.290
Uh, yeah...

00:53:53.835 --> 00:53:55.712
I just finished!

00:53:55.712 --> 00:53:57.422
Good job!

00:53:58.256 --> 00:54:02.010
After what happened at school,
you can't let your guard down.

00:54:02.010 --> 00:54:02.677
Yeah.

00:54:02.677 --> 00:54:06.556
It'd be good to know where
the card's lurking right now, though...

00:54:07.599 --> 00:54:09.476
Sorry to make you wait!

00:54:10.143 --> 00:54:11.436
That was fast.

00:54:11.519 --> 00:54:13.062
Of course.

00:54:13.062 --> 00:54:17.108
If I couldn't put the final touches on
Sakura being a princess,

00:54:17.108 --> 00:54:19.444
I'd regret it for the rest of my life!

00:54:20.361 --> 00:54:23.823
You'd regret something like that
for the rest of your life?

00:54:24.240 --> 00:54:26.117
To each their own.

00:54:26.785 --> 00:54:29.537
One must live each day
so there are no regrets.

00:54:39.088 --> 00:54:41.049
Everyone, it's about time to begin!

00:54:41.049 --> 00:54:42.383
Okay!

00:54:42.383 --> 00:54:45.637
Nadeshiko Festival

00:54:45.637 --> 00:54:46.888
Nadeshiko Festival
Excuse me.

00:54:47.514 --> 00:54:49.474
Oh, excuse me.

00:54:49.474 --> 00:54:50.600
Sir!

00:54:50.725 --> 00:54:52.018
Sonomi.

00:54:52.185 --> 00:54:54.395
Oh, is that space free?

00:54:54.395 --> 00:54:55.563
Yes.

00:54:56.314 --> 00:54:58.525
Were you listening
to Tomoyo's song?

00:54:58.525 --> 00:55:00.568
I recorded it on video, of course.

00:55:00.902 --> 00:55:02.487
I'd like to see it later.

00:55:06.241 --> 00:55:07.784
Just a camera?

00:55:07.784 --> 00:55:08.660
Yes.

00:55:08.993 --> 00:55:11.788
Sakura is the princess; the lead role.

00:55:11.955 --> 00:55:16.334
Fine, I'll make you a copy
of what I record.

00:55:22.090 --> 00:55:23.967
Th-Thank you.

00:55:25.009 --> 00:55:26.219
And now...

00:55:26.219 --> 00:55:29.931
Tomoeda Elementary
Grade 6, Class 2...

00:55:29.931 --> 00:55:32.100
...would like to begin their play.

00:55:53.121 --> 00:55:54.038
It's Sakura.

00:55:54.038 --> 00:55:55.290
Sakura!

00:56:01.462 --> 00:56:06.676
The war with our neighboring countries over
the Magic Stone must be wearing on you, Princess.

00:56:06.676 --> 00:56:10.346
In this ball, everyone wears a mask.

00:56:10.722 --> 00:56:13.766
Please enjoy it
to your heart's content.

00:56:14.726 --> 00:56:15.852
Thank you.

00:56:16.227 --> 00:56:19.564
But I am not a great dancer.

00:56:19.564 --> 00:56:20.940
It's all right!

00:56:21.232 --> 00:56:25.987
The best way to improve
is to dance with a great dancer.

00:56:28.239 --> 00:56:29.157
Now...

00:56:30.825 --> 00:56:31.701
Now.

00:56:44.881 --> 00:56:45.965
No...

00:56:46.299 --> 00:56:49.385
I can't dance with someone
I don't know, after all.

00:56:49.802 --> 00:56:53.097
And I wonder where
the Magic Stone has gone...

00:56:54.390 --> 00:56:55.975
The Magic Stone...

00:56:55.975 --> 00:56:59.479
Hold it, and wondrous powers
are yours to command, it's said.

00:57:00.229 --> 00:57:04.150
We've been fighting over it with
the other countries for so long...

00:57:06.653 --> 00:57:08.988
If only there were
no such thing as war.

00:57:09.572 --> 00:57:13.159
And the Magic Stone that causes war...

00:57:13.159 --> 00:57:17.664
...is probably better off gone
than in someone's hands.

00:57:17.664 --> 00:57:18.706
Indeed.

00:57:22.794 --> 00:57:24.504
I agree.

00:57:26.047 --> 00:57:27.507
May I ask who you are?

00:57:28.132 --> 00:57:30.593
The etiquette here is
to not ask for identities.

00:57:30.593 --> 00:57:32.053
That's right.

00:57:32.553 --> 00:57:35.640
This is my first time
attending a masked ball...

00:57:35.640 --> 00:57:36.891
Mine, as well.

00:57:36.891 --> 00:57:37.892
Oh, my!

00:57:38.434 --> 00:57:42.689
Every day is just so busy,
I think I've even forgotten how to dance...

00:57:42.981 --> 00:57:48.027
My attendants brought me here today,
as I tend to lock myself away.

00:57:48.027 --> 00:57:49.487
Myself, as well.

00:57:51.197 --> 00:57:52.490
Hating war...

00:57:52.865 --> 00:57:54.450
First ball...

00:57:54.742 --> 00:57:57.286
We are quite alike.

00:57:58.371 --> 00:57:59.288
Yes.

00:58:04.043 --> 00:58:05.670
Will you dance with me?

00:58:05.670 --> 00:58:08.047
But dancing is not one of my...

00:58:08.548 --> 00:58:10.133
I am not good, either.

00:58:10.341 --> 00:58:12.719
I am sure to step on your feet.

00:58:12.719 --> 00:58:15.430
Then I will do my best
to dodge yours.

00:59:02.894 --> 00:59:04.604
It's already started.

00:59:04.604 --> 00:59:06.981
Why's she dancing
with that twerp?

00:59:12.487 --> 00:59:15.615
Much better than
the princess he was last time.

00:59:15.823 --> 00:59:17.658
It's looking good.

00:59:25.917 --> 00:59:28.961
Then you are the prince
of our neighboring country...

00:59:28.961 --> 00:59:31.339
The country we are fighting?

00:59:31.714 --> 00:59:34.217
Princess, do stop crying.

00:59:34.467 --> 00:59:36.552
A smile suits you
more than anyone.

00:59:36.636 --> 00:59:39.180
Please forgive me
for making you so sad.

00:59:39.347 --> 00:59:40.389
However...

00:59:40.681 --> 00:59:42.892
I cannot stop these feelings.

00:59:46.521 --> 00:59:47.563
I---

00:59:51.609 --> 00:59:52.485
I am...

00:59:52.944 --> 00:59:54.403
...in love with you.

00:59:56.072 --> 00:59:57.365
I---

00:59:58.157 --> 01:00:02.453
I am unable to respond
to your feelings.

01:00:03.246 --> 01:00:05.373
Do you not like me?

01:00:05.373 --> 01:00:06.582
It's not that!

01:00:09.210 --> 01:00:10.503
It isn't...

01:00:10.878 --> 01:00:11.754
...that.

01:00:17.760 --> 01:00:19.220
It's great...

01:00:19.512 --> 01:00:21.180
It's looking good...

01:00:24.767 --> 01:00:25.768
I---

01:00:26.894 --> 01:00:28.062
I---

01:00:31.774 --> 01:00:33.776
No, I cannot say it.

01:00:34.026 --> 01:00:36.529
I cannot tell you this feeling I have...

01:00:36.988 --> 01:00:37.947
No...

01:00:38.364 --> 01:00:39.615
Especially you.

01:00:40.158 --> 01:00:44.412
Please forget
everything about me.

01:00:45.997 --> 01:00:48.666
Please take me out of your heart.

01:00:50.001 --> 01:00:50.835
Princess!

01:00:53.129 --> 01:00:54.088
What?

01:00:54.589 --> 01:00:56.048
- Are you all right?
- Yeah.

01:01:00.136 --> 01:01:01.596
This presence...

01:01:03.681 --> 01:01:04.682
No!

01:01:10.104 --> 01:01:10.980
Look out!

01:01:21.240 --> 01:01:21.949
What is this?

01:01:22.909 --> 01:01:23.743
Toya!

01:01:25.077 --> 01:01:26.245
Sakura!

01:01:35.254 --> 01:01:36.255
Sakura!

01:01:37.256 --> 01:01:39.050
- Are you all right?
- Sakura!

01:01:39.050 --> 01:01:40.092
Everyone...

01:01:40.384 --> 01:01:42.386
Everyone disappeared
on our end, too!

01:01:43.429 --> 01:01:45.890
Is this the doing
of the Sealed Card?

01:01:46.265 --> 01:01:47.600
Looks like it.

01:01:49.894 --> 01:01:52.438
I have to hurry and change it
into a Sakura Card...

01:01:52.813 --> 01:01:54.315
...So everyone will come back!

01:01:54.315 --> 01:01:55.483
I'll go with you.

01:01:56.359 --> 01:01:57.652
Syaoran!

01:02:01.739 --> 01:02:02.907
I'll go with you.

01:02:07.036 --> 01:02:09.997
Then please wear this.

01:02:10.539 --> 01:02:12.250
T-Tomoyo?

01:02:12.667 --> 01:02:15.753
You know, Miss Daidoji,
at a time like this...

01:02:16.587 --> 01:02:19.423
I'd like her to wear it
because it's a time like this.

01:02:19.548 --> 01:02:25.179
I have saved all the costumes
that Sakura has worn in the past.

01:02:25.471 --> 01:02:30.518
She always returned with a smile,
no matter what happened.

01:02:31.560 --> 01:02:34.438
Together with
the costume that I made...

01:02:34.647 --> 01:02:39.068
So I'm sure she will come back
safe and sound this time, too.

01:02:39.694 --> 01:02:41.028
Tomoyo...

01:02:43.114 --> 01:02:48.202
I'll do my best and come back
with the clothes you made me.

01:02:48.953 --> 01:02:50.204
I promise.

01:02:52.081 --> 01:02:54.375
And this is for you, Li.

01:02:57.962 --> 01:03:01.215
It would be horrible to be
the only one not to come back.

01:03:01.757 --> 01:03:05.177
Please wear this
and help Sakura out.

01:03:05.845 --> 01:03:10.182
Both of you, come back safely
so we can take a souvenir photo.

01:03:10.182 --> 01:03:11.017
Right.

01:03:12.268 --> 01:03:13.311
Yeah.

01:03:36.042 --> 01:03:37.668
This is horrible...

01:03:38.377 --> 01:03:41.130
We have to hurry
and find that card.

01:03:41.672 --> 01:03:43.299
It's not that far away.

01:03:43.466 --> 01:03:46.135
I'm sure it's somewhere in town.

01:03:46.469 --> 01:03:48.763
But where should you look?

01:03:52.183 --> 01:03:53.142
Again...

01:03:56.687 --> 01:03:59.231
The Key which hides
powers of the Stars!

01:03:59.690 --> 01:04:02.109
Show your true form before me!

01:04:03.694 --> 01:04:06.781
I, Sakura, command you
under our contract!

01:04:07.156 --> 01:04:09.033
RELEASE!

01:04:15.289 --> 01:04:16.457
WINDY!

01:04:34.934 --> 01:04:36.060
Why?

01:04:46.695 --> 01:04:48.614
Tomoyo! Meiling!

01:04:49.782 --> 01:04:50.658
Don't!

01:05:00.126 --> 01:05:01.252
Just hold on!

01:05:01.335 --> 01:05:03.462
We'll make everything
go back to normal!

01:05:04.505 --> 01:05:05.923
Sakura, I figured it out.

01:05:06.382 --> 01:05:09.176
I know where the Sealed Card is.

01:05:09.176 --> 01:05:10.136
Where?

01:05:10.886 --> 01:05:12.888
Where the cards flew to.

01:05:16.392 --> 01:05:17.726
The amusement park...

01:05:22.106 --> 01:05:24.525
I have five cards left...

01:05:50.509 --> 01:05:51.552
I feel it.

01:05:51.886 --> 01:05:53.471
The presence of a Clow Card.

01:05:53.721 --> 01:05:55.473
I'm sure it's here somewhere.

01:06:48.567 --> 01:06:50.110
The card's doing this.

01:06:53.531 --> 01:06:54.406
JUMP!

01:07:03.082 --> 01:07:04.333
What now?

01:07:06.001 --> 01:07:07.169
How...

01:07:17.638 --> 01:07:18.556
TIME!

01:07:37.199 --> 01:07:38.242
There it is!

01:07:38.867 --> 01:07:39.827
Be careful!

01:07:40.035 --> 01:07:41.787
TIME's magic is weakening!

01:07:45.165 --> 01:07:46.208
You're...

01:07:46.208 --> 01:07:48.252
You're the Sealed Card, right?

01:07:51.297 --> 01:07:52.506
Why?

01:07:52.506 --> 01:07:54.383
Why are you doing this?

01:07:58.762 --> 01:08:00.180
Four more.

01:08:00.598 --> 01:08:03.225
Please! Bring everyone back!

01:08:03.517 --> 01:08:05.185
No good! TIME is disappearing!

01:08:10.149 --> 01:08:11.108
Kero!

01:08:13.819 --> 01:08:15.279
Is talking to it useless?

01:08:23.495 --> 01:08:24.580
Yue!

01:08:29.251 --> 01:08:30.377
Damn it!

01:08:37.801 --> 01:08:40.012
No good!
It's not working at all!

01:08:48.395 --> 01:08:50.314
Kero, get out of there!

01:08:52.983 --> 01:08:54.443
Kero!

01:09:00.240 --> 01:09:01.450
Kero...

01:09:01.700 --> 01:09:02.868
Yue...

01:09:03.077 --> 01:09:04.161
Why?

01:09:04.828 --> 01:09:08.290
The guardians of the cards
were also created by Clow Reed.

01:09:10.000 --> 01:09:13.671
So that means things created by
Clow Reed won't work against it.

01:09:13.671 --> 01:09:15.089
That can't be...

01:09:15.464 --> 01:09:18.050
At this rate, everyone will disappear!

01:09:18.759 --> 01:09:20.135
What should ...

01:09:20.678 --> 01:09:21.804
What should...

01:09:23.180 --> 01:09:25.265
S-Syaoran?

01:09:32.314 --> 01:09:35.943
My powers don't use
the Clow Cards.

01:09:36.318 --> 01:09:37.569
Maybe...

01:10:00.259 --> 01:10:02.594
God of Thunder, answer my call!

01:10:13.230 --> 01:10:15.190
Return to being a card!

01:10:18.819 --> 01:10:20.154
Syaoran!

01:10:24.491 --> 01:10:25.993
Don't get in my way...

01:10:26.243 --> 01:10:28.328
Fire God, answer my call!

01:10:28.328 --> 01:10:30.038
Don't get in my way!

01:10:32.124 --> 01:10:32.833
FLY!

01:10:41.049 --> 01:10:42.301
Syaoran...

01:10:45.637 --> 01:10:46.638
Everyone...

01:10:47.097 --> 01:10:48.140
Everyone...

01:10:49.850 --> 01:10:51.310
...Is gone.

01:10:52.060 --> 01:10:54.521
I don't like this at all...

01:10:57.858 --> 01:11:00.360
I won't give up.

01:11:00.861 --> 01:11:05.741
I will never, ever give up!

01:11:41.109 --> 01:11:42.361
Two more.

01:11:59.670 --> 01:12:01.171
One more.

01:12:01.672 --> 01:12:02.714
SHIELD!

01:12:24.528 --> 01:12:27.114
And now I have them all.

01:12:29.700 --> 01:12:32.452
I'll seal you away.

01:12:32.744 --> 01:12:34.872
And I'll bring everyone back.

01:12:35.414 --> 01:12:36.498
No!

01:12:41.920 --> 01:12:44.131
I've been alone for all this time!

01:12:45.090 --> 01:12:48.427
Sealed away in a cold, dark place.

01:12:49.386 --> 01:12:50.888
I was lonely...

01:12:51.179 --> 01:12:54.433
I finally have my friends back.
Why are you interfering?

01:12:54.433 --> 01:12:56.518
You can't call them friends!

01:12:57.561 --> 01:13:01.189
Forcefully making them yours
isn't making friends...

01:13:01.481 --> 01:13:03.025
That's not right!

01:13:03.025 --> 01:13:04.401
It's not!

01:13:10.198 --> 01:13:11.325
Everyone...

01:13:11.533 --> 01:13:12.659
Why?

01:13:13.035 --> 01:13:14.912
Do you hate me?

01:13:15.120 --> 01:13:18.290
Am I no longer friends with you all?

01:13:18.624 --> 01:13:20.083
Why?

01:13:42.314 --> 01:13:43.941
It's all right.

01:13:45.859 --> 01:13:47.903
Come on and join everyone else.

01:13:50.739 --> 01:13:52.491
I won't be alone?

01:13:52.491 --> 01:13:53.492
You won't.

01:13:53.492 --> 01:13:55.494
They all want you
to come with them.

01:14:03.335 --> 01:14:05.712
Return to the guise
you were meant to be in.

01:14:06.046 --> 01:14:08.131
CLOW CARD!

01:14:15.389 --> 01:14:19.601
I guess I wasn't able to tell him
how I feel, after all...

01:14:23.230 --> 01:14:25.565
Card created by Clow...

01:14:25.899 --> 01:14:28.402
...abandon your old form and reincarnate.

01:14:28.819 --> 01:14:30.487
Under the name...

01:14:33.365 --> 01:14:35.325
...of your new master, Sakura!

01:14:46.336 --> 01:14:47.421
Syaoran!

01:14:49.423 --> 01:14:51.383
I'm glad I made it in time...

01:14:52.050 --> 01:14:55.470
It looks like I had more
magic power left than you.

01:14:55.846 --> 01:15:01.101
I mean... you did have to use
SO0 many cards in one day, after all...

01:15:01.768 --> 01:15:03.103
Syaoran...

01:15:04.604 --> 01:15:07.315
Even if my feelings disappear, I'm sure...

01:15:08.650 --> 01:15:11.236
...that once again, Sakura, I'll...

01:15:14.531 --> 01:15:16.783
Syaoran!

01:15:43.977 --> 01:15:45.353
Don't cry.

01:15:45.729 --> 01:15:46.938
It's all right.

01:16:05.749 --> 01:16:06.833
Huh?

01:16:07.000 --> 01:16:08.126
It's her...

01:16:14.132 --> 01:16:15.634
Syaoran...

01:16:18.553 --> 01:16:22.265
Syaoran, even if you think
nothing of me, it's all right.

01:16:23.517 --> 01:16:25.852
I'm in love with you.

01:16:26.728 --> 01:16:29.981
You're my everything, Syaoran.

01:16:39.324 --> 01:16:40.450
And you're mine.

01:16:47.332 --> 01:16:48.458
Sakura.

01:16:52.546 --> 01:16:57.134
Please deliver this voice.

01:16:57.134 --> 01:17:01.721
Please relay the message right now.

01:17:01.721 --> 01:17:06.351
Please hurry and come over here.

01:17:06.351 --> 01:17:13.441
Please feel a power yet to be seen.

01:17:13.441 --> 01:17:17.654
I want you to believe.

01:17:17.904 --> 01:17:21.032
Look, the continuation of the dream.

01:17:21.032 --> 01:17:26.121
It's singing the melody leading to tomorrow.

01:17:26.121 --> 01:17:27.747
Here goes!

01:17:27.747 --> 01:17:29.457
Hey, don't do that!

01:17:29.457 --> 01:17:31.668
The stairs will come back,
just wait a second!

01:17:31.668 --> 01:17:32.878
No chance!

01:17:36.298 --> 01:17:37.716
I love you!

01:17:38.675 --> 01:17:42.721
Please deliver this voice.

01:17:42.721 --> 01:17:46.766
Please relay the message right now.

01:17:46.766 --> 01:17:50.854
Please hurry and come over here.

01:17:50.854 --> 01:17:56.943
A strange yet nostalgic heartbeat...

01:17:57.194 --> 01:18:00.864
You can hear it, right?

01:18:01.031 --> 01:18:10.332
A distant memory,
and now a story weaving them begins.

01:18:12.459 --> 01:18:17.756
Words I couldn't say...

01:18:20.592 --> 01:18:26.306
...are overflowing in my arms.

01:18:29.726 --> 01:18:33.813
The diary of my heart...

01:18:33.813 --> 01:18:37.901
Whenever I flip through it...

01:18:37.901 --> 01:18:43.406
...you were right there at my side.

01:18:45.784 --> 01:18:49.829
With an invisible promise...

01:18:49.829 --> 01:18:53.917
...we met each other.

01:18:53.917 --> 01:18:57.963
Please tell me the reason why...

01:18:57.963 --> 01:19:08.139
...you still remember the oath
we took that day, right?

01:19:08.139 --> 01:19:10.934
To this sky we look up to...

01:19:10.934 --> 01:19:16.690
Let's raise a rainbow of hope
that continues forever.

01:19:18.358 --> 01:19:22.362
Please deliver this voice.

01:19:22.362 --> 01:19:26.491
Please relay the message right now.

01:19:26.491 --> 01:19:30.495
Please hurry and come over here.

01:19:30.495 --> 01:19:36.501
Please feel the faint fever in my heart.

01:19:36.876 --> 01:19:40.422
You knew it, right?

01:19:40.714 --> 01:19:43.466
Look, the continuation of the dream.

01:19:43.466 --> 01:19:49.764
It's singing the melody leading to tomorrow.

01:20:09.451 --> 01:20:13.455
The miracle of falling in love.

01:20:13.455 --> 01:20:17.083
Unweaving its secrets.

01:20:17.542 --> 01:20:23.590
I run over to where you are...

01:20:25.467 --> 01:20:29.512
Please deliver this voice.

01:20:29.512 --> 01:20:33.558
Please relay the message right now.

01:20:33.558 --> 01:20:37.562
As if it was something never seen before.

01:20:37.562 --> 01:20:43.651
A glimmering future yet to be known.

01:20:43.860 --> 01:20:47.572
Let's go look for it.

01:20:47.781 --> 01:20:50.575
Don't be afraid of anything.

01:20:50.575 --> 01:20:56.748
If we're together, we can go without giving up.

01:20:57.957 --> 01:21:02.045
Please deliver this voice.

01:21:02.045 --> 01:21:06.132
Please relay the message right now.

01:21:06.132 --> 01:21:10.136
Please hurry and come over here.

01:21:10.136 --> 01:21:16.184
Please feel the faint fever in my heart.

01:21:16.518 --> 01:21:20.146
You knew it, right?

01:21:20.355 --> 01:21:23.149
Look, the continuation of the dream.

01:21:23.149 --> 01:21:30.824
It's singing the melody leading to tomorrow.

01:21:46.840 --> 01:21:50.844
Please deliver...

01:21:50.844 --> 01:21:54.973
Please relay...

01:21:54.973 --> 01:21:59.561
Please hurry...

01:22:03.106 --> 01:22:07.026
Please deliver...
